2026-07-27T12:35:01.1570466Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:35:01.1570929Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:35:01.1571651Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:35:01.1573022Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:35:01.1573843Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
